{"availability":"available","full":"Aelowww/Teech","name":"Teech","description":"A web-based platform for students and faculty to schedule, manage, and track consultation appointments.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-18T02:38:12Z","updated":"2026-10-04T06:43:31Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://teech-app.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://teech-app.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:38.309Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:38.309Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:38.309Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:51:38.309Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Student and faculty consultation booking web app. Teacher within your reach.","We built Teech because booking a consultation with a teacher at our school is honestly a hassle. You message them, wait, they reply late, the time doesn't work anymore, and you start over. Teech puts everything in one place: faculty post the dates and rooms they're free, students pick a slot and send a request, and faculty just confirm or decline. It has a mobile layout for phones and a full desktop layout for computers, both on the same URLs."],"features":["Students and faculty sign in with email; students confirm their email with a 6-digit code when signing up","Students sign up with just a name, email, and password, then submit their Student ID, department, and ID photo from inside the app; booking unlocks once an admin approves it","Admin console at /admin with a live dashboard and separate Students and Faculty verification queues","Faculty upload a photo of their Faculty ID when signing up and can't sign in until an admin approves it; they get an email with the decision","Admin portal at /admin, protected by password plus authenticator-app two-step verification"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Aelowww/Teech/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"752a3b6c432c81a332112e0f41